        "title": "qualitywebdata.org",
        "url": "http://qualitywebdata.org/",
        "notes": "Here we gather resources regarding the quality of Web Data, especially concerning Linked Data.\r\n\r\nWe have plenty of data available in the Linked Open Data cloud, but also have a lot issues regarding data quality. Here we gather resources regarding the quality of Web Data, especially concerning Linked Data, and hence provide a dashboard for anyone interested to produce and/or consume Quality Web Data. ",
